pecific examples  reviewing them in these tagged lists  that i have  or getting a book like this which has a  lot of patterns minimal explanation the  explanation takes you away from the  pattern to my mind it's indirect kind of  explaining stuff that you kind of have  understand  i'm saying you shouldn't i'm not saying  you shouldn't do it but i would rely far  more on constant review of these  patterns  in order to create these new patterns in  your brain so that you start to do  things naturally so there you have it  that's my take on the whole issue of  learning  you know verb endings noun endings  adjective endings and so forth and so on  i hope that this was helpful thank you  for listening and send me more questions
 

